  "bio": {
    "zh": "Di Sarli 的辨識度極高，靠的不是花俏，而是極簡克制。低音厚重緩慢，並大膽留下空拍——「什麼都沒發生」的瞬間反而更有張力。舞者形容：像絲絨，但底下藏著鋼鐵。",
    "en": "Di Sarli's sound is instantly recognisable through restraint, not ornament. Heavy, unhurried bass and bold silences—the empty beats carry the drama. Dancers call it velvet with steel underneath."
  },
  "sound_description": {
    "zh": "Marcato en dos／Pesante：低音八度齊奏、大量留白、動態對比強。少彈幾個音，但把每個音的重量感做足。",
    "en": "Marcato en dos / pesante: octave bass unisons, generous pauses, strong dynamic contrast. Fewer notes, each carrying real weight."
  },
